## Interface: 120105
## Title: TrialChat
## Notes: TrialChat provides nearby chat, whisper-based password-protected group chats, clickable links, WoW emotes, timestamps, right-click replies, and persistent history. Group history synchronization and offline group instances require all group members to use the same addon version. Use /tc to open nearby chat.
